on></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>招生专业</span></strong></span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>（一）硕士研究生</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>全日制学术学位硕士071000生物学（包括以下3个研究方向：植物学、微生物学、生物化学与分子生物学）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>全日制专业学位硕士095100农业（包括以下4个研究方向：农艺与种业、资源利用与植物保护、食品加工与安全、农业工程与信息技术）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>（二）博士研究生</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>全日制学术学位博士071000生物学（包括以下3个研究方向：植物学、微生物学、生物化学与分子生物学）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>全日制专业学位博士095100农业（包括以下4个研究方向：农艺与种业、资源利用与植物保护、食品加工与安全、农业工程与信息技术）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>最终以教育部推免系统公布的2027年推免招生专业目录为准。最终录取专业以“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”中录取确认为准。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请条件</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></p></li><li><p><span>2027届普通全日制本科毕业生，有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></p></li><li><p><span>研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></p></li><li><p><span>身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求;</span></p></li></ol></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请程序及复试安排</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJUCaMyOwAh5Jy6ibZcZ1e7nTkusicXbvHocYDuMmdovalyfeqyBAT5oxl99ZDVhQkgdEj6QvlxbqtmRP0UyLmwzFy55VkUd24GU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）</span></strong><strong><span>预报名</span></strong></p></section><section><p><strong><span>2026年8月30日—9月9日</span></strong><span>，凡有意报考我院2027年推荐免试研究生的申请人登录“湖南大学接收推免生报名信息采集系统” https://yjszsxt.hnu.edu.cn/zsxt/tmsgl/default.aspx进行网上预报名，如实填写各项信息，将以下材料</span><strong><span>按照1-5项顺序</span></strong><span>整理成一个PDF文件（不超过10M），上传推免生报名信息采集系统。</span></p></section><section><p><span>申请材料包括：</span></p><p><span>1.个人简历、身份证和学生证；</span></p><p><span>2.本科成绩单和总评成绩排名证明(由教务处盖章或所在学院盖章)；</span></p><p><span>3.英语水平证明材料（CET-4、CET-6、TOEFL、IELTS等成绩单）；</span></p><p><span>4.学术科研成果（公开发表的论文等）和获奖证书；</span></p><p><span>5.参加社会实践、公益事业等的证明材料；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dLngjYhicSTTu0ibEPp2HqDG8Q4HCbXTSS2wD8iaiceiaOibFibCSq3M4wz9ib7j6G6gD6TbqjObpUenWmiaia7CmuVFGyStmh9Dkelyib6tc/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（二）资格审查</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span>学院将根据申请人提供的申请材料进行资格审查，择优确定参加复试考核的名单。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dJUCaMyOwAh5Jy6ibZcZ1e7nTkusicXbvHocYDuMmdovalyfeqyBAT5oxl99ZDVhQkgdEj6QvlxbqtmRP0UyLmwzFy55VkUd24GU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>（三）复试考核</span></strong></p></section><section><p><span>1.考核形式：线下现场面试</span></p><p><span>2.考核时间：</span><strong><span>2026年9月13日</span></strong></p><p><span>3.考核地点：岳麓山实验室1号楼（湖南省长沙市芙蓉区东湖街道红旗路246号）</span></p><p><span>4.考核时长：不少于 20 分钟</span></p><p><span>5.考核内容及分值（总分 100 分，60 分合格）</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dLc1NJQyz7QTxW66QK5g1ftIhLGhCAicBzNQBErAaKG4yEUIXwVMtDSdydibQGtv01yrUprf1cXu3aRBTOgln0l8qumCyuubkpdw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>综合素质测试（40 分）</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>由考生通过PPT汇报（限时5分钟）说明本科专业学习基本情况，包括专业排名、外语等级证书、发表论文及其他获奖情况。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dLc1NJQyz7QTxW66QK5g1ftIhLGhCAicBzNQBErAaKG4yEUIXwVMtDSdydibQGtv01yrUprf1cXu3aRBTOgln0l8qumCyuubkpdw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>专业素质测试（40 分）</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>由现场面试考核人员提问，考生作答。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/btLkCxjz5dLc1NJQyz7QTxW66QK5g1ftIhLGhCAicBzNQBErAaKG4yEUIXwVMtDSdydibQGtv01yrUprf1cXu3aRBTOgln0l8qumCyuubkpdw/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>外语能力测试（20 分）</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>由考生随机抽取英文问题，考生用英语作答。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>拟录取工作</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>学院按照“择优录取、保证质量、宁缺毋滥”的原则，根据考核成绩，综合考生思想政治表现、身心健康状况等，在各专业接收推免生计划限额内择优拟录取。</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span>2026年9月21日</span></strong><span>，获得推免生资格且考核合格的申请人在“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开暨管理服务系统”（网址：https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm，以下简称“教育部推免服务系统”）报名。我院通过教育部推免服务系统向考生发送待录取通知，通知考生进行确认。考生收到待录取通知后，按照学院规定时间在教育部推免服务系统确认或拒绝待录取。逾期未确认的考生，视为自动放弃拟录取资格。</span></p></li><li><p><span>针对未进行预报名但仅在教育部推免服务系统报名的考生，学院将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否组织复试。</span></p></li></ol></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>黄老师：simplelife_00@163.com，0731-88823793；</span></p><p><span>易老师：2990897126@qq.com，0731-84691831。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>其他说明</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><ol><li><p><span>对学术不端及弄虚作假者，不论何时，一经查实，即按相关规定取消报考资格、录取资格或取消学籍。</span></p></li><li><p><span>学校将对新生入学资格进行复查，推免生如在录取当年入学时未取得国家承认的本科毕业证书，录取资格无效。</span></p></li><li><p><span>根据教育部政策规定，取得录取资格的推免生不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生招生考试，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></p></li><li><p><span>其他未尽事宜，按照湖南大学研究生院相关文件及我院补充通知执行。</span></p></li></ol></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/flQiam4PJhLoVIyXxOxhFpsEOG3FXRC3B7tAf42FibhlDYoB60QA4IeWAmsibAOzibym5h9bNe7iaiaz3OBOniapGW923sxu71rYpTMzMQb8WNyooU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>编辑丨魏茜茜</span></span></p><p><span><span>责编丨李梦艳</span></span></p><p><span><span>初审丨黄有为</span></span></p><p><span><span>复审丨付裕隆</span></span></p><p><span><span>终审丨姚瑞枫</span></span></p></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"888e3d195e7d37309229bc0198b1b45892a1aa56f9b96556b2cf3fa464af76ee","textLength":1662,"sourceSha256":"644560c6057f0862fd72e698132d0475a74d7d05105c04cf39f52fdc0d36b98f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-8d07ca3cd8ad6043ad40","title":"2026年湖南大学隆平农学院2027年招收推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）复试录取工作实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:21.772403+00:00"}
